  "body": "Offering an impressive 205sqm (approx.) of total area, including internal-access double garaging and storage, this understated yet luxurious, moody, sleek and sophisticated apartment in an exclusive boutique complex will captivate the discerning who refuse to compromise. Beautifully crafted in 2024, it enjoys a peaceful position among quality homes just above Vellenoweth Green.\r\n\r\nLift access delivers you directly to your own entrance, creating security and exclusivity. North-facing floor-to-ceiling glazing floods the generous open living with natural light, while a refined palette of dark oak flooring, subtle ECC planned lighting, and remote-controlled blinds combined with modern sheers creates understated elegance.\r\n\r\nDesigned for entertaining, the spacious internal balcony extends the living area year-round. Retracting glass sliders bring the outside in, while the streamlined kitchen impresses with integrated beverage storage, dark ceramic benchtops, Gaggenau ovens, cooktop, and fridge freezer plus a hidden pantry. Discreet ducted air conditioning ensures perfect comfort through every season.\r\n\r\n\r\nThree bedrooms provide flexibility. One is thoughtfully fitted as a media room or home office with versatile bespoke cabinetry and desk. The luxurious main suite features a fitted dressing room leading to a striking ensuite finished in dark tiling with black plantation shutters. Equally stylish, the family bathroom includes a freestanding bath. Internal-access double garaging completes the package.\r\n\r\nFeatures:\r\n\r\n• Approx. 205sqm total area, comprising 161sqm apartment and enclosed balcony, 42sqm internal-access double garage and 2sqm storage\r\n\r\n• Lift access directly to your personal entrance\r\n\r\n• Ducted air conditioning throughout\r\n\r\n• Three bedrooms, including one configured as a media room or home office\r\n\r\n• Two beautifully appointed bathrooms, including a family bathroom with freestanding bath\r\n\r\n• Luxurious main suite with fitted dressing room and ensuite\r\n\r\nEnjoy the ease of premium apartment living without sacrificing space, style or luxury, just moments from St Heliers Beach and the cafés, restaurants and boutiques of St Heliers Village.\r\n\r\nSee interactive features for this property on barfoot.co.nz. Click the \"View office website\" link at the bottom of this page.",
